					<item>
				<guid>http://www.scpwiki.com/forum/t-1387665#post-2402388</guid>
				<title>(no title)</title>
				<link>http://www.scpwiki.com/forum/t-1387665/sunnyclockwork-s-artwork-scp-cards#post-2402388</link>
				<description></description>
				<pubDate>Thu, 05 Nov 2015 00:49:39 +0000</pubDate>
				<wikidot:authorName>DrMorris</wikidot:authorName>				<wikidot:authorUserId>2231487</wikidot:authorUserId>				<content:encoded>
					<![CDATA[
						 <p>Quoting the page:</p> <blockquote> <p>This false containment procedure has been given a sense of veracity by the following means:</p> <ul> <li>Incorporating references to similar but unrelated occult entities.</li> </ul> </blockquote> <p>It might be better to just cut out the reference to SCP-2317, but that's just me being nitpicky.</p> 
				 	]]>
				</content:encoded>							</item>
